  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss10:1.1": "The nuns’ offenses entailing suspension 7, 8, and 9 are identical to [pli-tv-bu-vb-ss5:2.2.13.1](), [pli-tv-bu-vb-ss8:1.9.32.1](), and [pli-tv-bu-vb-ss9:1.2.14.1]() respectively. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss10:1.2": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss10:1.3": "",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-ss10:1.4": "According to Sp-ṭ 2.709 _kinnumāva_ should be read as _kiṁ nu imā eva_. _Kinnumāva samaṇiyo yā samaṇiyo sakyadhītaro_ might then be rendered quite literally as, “Those ascetics who are daughters of the Sakyan (_yā samaṇiyo sakyadhītaro_), why are just these ones ascetics (_kinnumāva samaṇiyo_)?” ",
